---
description: Safety and determinism rules for FHIR and EMA interoperability files
globs:
  - "src/fhir/**/*.ts"
  - "fhir/**/*"
  - "fixtures/**/*"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Never invent or rewrite regulated narrative.
- Preserve source XHTML byte-for-byte after normalization at the containing JSON boundary.
- Every target field must be copied, code-mapped, structurally moved, defaulted by a pinned
  rule, or rejected.
- Add regression tests for cardinality, ordering, references, and profile selection.
- Any standards artifact update requires version, source URL, commit where applicable, SHA-256,
  changelog review, fixture revalidation, and explicit approval evidence.
